  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Universal Basic Education Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project would support Government of Nigeria&apos;s plans to implement a program to achieve universal basic education (UBE).  The objective of the Bank&apos;s support would be to increase the capacity of states and local governments to manage and implement the UBE program effectively and efficiently.  The goals are to assist states and local governments to establish and manage schools with local participation and to build capacity in critical skills such as budgeting, participatory planning, financial management, procurement, and project implementation.  (PAD, p. 2)</narrative>
  </description>
